  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 8 Over 5 x plus 6 EndFraction\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>?</p>",
