  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"one half\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. The value of <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the value of <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 2\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in the given equation yields <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals StartFraction 8 Over 5 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis plus 6 EndFraction\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals eight sixteenths\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals one half\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"one half\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. Note that 1/2 and .5 are examples of ways to enter a correct answer.</p>",
